            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Corral 1.0.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Drag-to-snap.</b> Drag a window to the left, right, or top edge to snap it (top maximizes). Toggle in Settings.</li>
  <li><b>Cross-display cycling.</b> Press the half shortcuts (⌃⌥ arrows) repeatedly to walk a window across your displays in half-screen steps.</li>
  <li><b>Undo last snap</b> with ⌃⌥Z.</li>
  <li><b>Per-app ignore list</b> in Settings for apps you don't want Corral to touch.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
